{"seq":15,"slug":"software-engineering-fundamentals","title":"软件工程基础","stage":"DONE","category":"cs-fundamentals","chapterCount":5,"docCount":17,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/software-engineering-fundamentals","rating":{"composite":3.89,"verdict":"stable","groups":{"quality":4.4,"coverage":3.75,"positioning":4,"strategic":3.33},"weights":{"quality":0.3,"coverage":0.25,"positioning":0.2,"strategic":0.25},"profile":{"composite":3.47,"verdict":"neutral","uScore":3.25}},"introHtml":"<h1 id=\"软件工程基础-简介\">软件工程基础 简介</h1><p>软件工程是一门研究如何系统化、规范化地构建和维护高质量软件的学科。它关注的不仅是代码本身，更包括需求分析、架构设计、测试验证和项目管理等贯穿软件生命周期的各个环节。对于每一位希望从&quot;能写代码&quot;进阶到&quot;能交付可靠软件&quot;的开发者来说，软件工程知识都是不可或缺的。</p>\n<p>本手册面向有一定开发经验的程序员，特别适合已经能独立完成功能开发但尚未系统思考过开发流程、设计原则和质量保障的工程师。无论你从事前端、后端还是全栈开发，这里涵盖的知识都将帮助你在团队协作和工程实践中做出更好的决策。</p>\n<p>全书共分为五个章节，建议按照顺序依次学习：</p>\n<p>第一章<strong>软件开发生命周期</strong>介绍软件项目从启动到交付的主要过程模型，包括瀑布模型与迭代开发、敏捷方法论以及 DevOps 文化。理解这些模型的优劣和适用场景，是选择合适开发流程的前提。</p>\n<p>第二章<strong>需求工程</strong>讲解如何系统地收集、分析和管理软件需求。本章涵盖需求分析方法、用例与用户故事的编写技巧，以及需求变更的管理策略。需求是软件项目的起点，需求质量直接影响后续所有阶段的成败。</p>\n<p>第三章<strong>软件设计原则</strong>聚焦于如何构建结构良好、易于维护的软件系统。本章讨论模块化与耦合度控制、抽象层的设计、设计文档的编写以及架构评估方法，帮助你在动手编码之前做出正确的设计决策。</p>\n<p>第四章<strong>测试理论</strong>系统介绍软件测试的层次体系与方法论，包括测试级别划分、测试用例设计技术、测试自动化策略以及质量度量指标。测试是保障软件质量的最后一道防线，也是工程文化成熟度的重要标志。</p>\n<p>第五章<strong>项目管理基础</strong>涵盖软件项目管理的核心技能，包括工作量估算与计划制定、风险识别与应对策略，以及技术债务的管理方法。这些知识对于技术负责人和有志于成长为技术管理者的开发者尤为重要。</p>\n<p>推荐从第一章开始建立对开发流程的全局认识，然后依次学习需求、设计、测试和项目管理。这五个主题构成了软件工程实践的完整闭环，每一个环节的薄弱都可能成为项目的风险点。</p>\n","chapters":[{"seq":1,"slug":"sdlc-models","title":"软件开发生命周期","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/software-engineering-fundamentals/sdlc-models","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"waterfall-and-iterative","title":"瀑布与迭代模型","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/software-engineering-fundamentals/sdlc-models/waterfall-and-iterative"},{"seq":2,"slug":"agile-methodology","title":"敏捷方法论","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/software-engineering-fundamentals/sdlc-models/agile-methodology"},{"seq":3,"slug":"devops-culture","title":"DevOps 文化","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/software-engineering-fundamentals/sdlc-models/devops-culture"}]},{"seq":2,"slug":"requirements","title":"需求工程","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/software-engineering-fundamentals/requirements","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"requirements-analysis","title":"需求分析","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/software-engineering-fundamentals/requirements/requirements-analysis"},{"seq":2,"slug":"use-cases-and-stories","title":"用例与用户故事","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/software-engineering-fundamentals/requirements/use-cases-and-stories"},{"seq":3,"slug":"requirements-management","title":"需求管理","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/software-engineering-fundamentals/requirements/requirements-management"}]},{"seq":3,"slug":"design-principles","title":"软件设计原则","docCount":4,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/software-engineering-fundamentals/design-principles","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"modularity-and-coupling","title":"模块化与耦合度控制","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/software-engineering-fundamentals/design-principles/modularity-and-coupling"},{"seq":2,"slug":"abstraction-layers","title":"抽象层设计","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/software-engineering-fundamentals/design-principles/abstraction-layers"},{"seq":3,"slug":"design-documentation","title":"设计文档化","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/software-engineering-fundamentals/design-principles/design-documentation"},{"seq":4,"slug":"architecture-evaluation","title":"架构评估","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/software-engineering-fundamentals/design-principles/architecture-evaluation"}]},{"seq":4,"slug":"testing-theory","title":"测试理论","docCount":4,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/software-engineering-fundamentals/testing-theory","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"testing-levels","title":"测试层次","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/software-engineering-fundamentals/testing-theory/testing-levels"},{"seq":2,"slug":"test-design-techniques","title":"测试设计技术","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/software-engineering-fundamentals/testing-theory/test-design-techniques"},{"seq":3,"slug":"test-automation","title":"测试自动化","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/software-engineering-fundamentals/testing-theory/test-automation"},{"seq":4,"slug":"quality-metrics","title":"质量度量","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/software-engineering-fundamentals/testing-theory/quality-metrics"}]},{"seq":5,"slug":"project-management","title":"项目管理基础","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/software-engineering-fundamentals/project-management","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"estimation-and-planning","title":"估算与规划","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/software-engineering-fundamentals/project-management/estimation-and-planning"},{"seq":2,"slug":"risk-management","title":"风险管理","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/software-engineering-fundamentals/project-management/risk-management"},{"seq":3,"slug":"technical-debt","title":"技术债务","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/software-engineering-fundamentals/project-management/technical-debt"}]}]}